---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Biggan.me"
  description="Biggan.me Privacy Policy detailing our data collection practices, Google AdSense cookies, analytics, and commitment to student privacy."
  lang="en"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8">
    <div class="space-y-3">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/30 text-cyan-400 text-xs font-mono">
        Legal & Compliance
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
        Effective Date: September 8, 2026. Protecting student and visitor privacy is fundamental to our educational mission.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base space-y-6 leading-relaxed bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">1. Data Minimization & Local Execution</h2>
      <p>
        Biggan.me does not require user registration or profile creation. All mathematical, physical, and chemical calculations are computed purely client-side within your browser environment. Your numeric inputs and formulas are not transmitted to or stored on our servers.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mt-6">2. Third-Party Advertising (Google AdSense)</h2>
      <p>
        We may partner with third-party advertising networks such as Google AdSense to serve non-intrusive educational and programmatic advertisements. Google uses cookies (such as the DoubleClick cookie) to serve ads based on prior visits to this website and other sites across the internet.
      </p>
      <p>
        Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-cyan-400 underline">Google Ads Settings</a> or through <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-cyan-400 underline">aboutads.info</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mt-6">3. Analytics & Diagnostic Logs</h2>
      <p>
        We collect anonymized telemetry data (such as browser type, device resolution, and aggregated page visits) via Google Analytics to diagnose performance bottlenecks and optimize Core Web Vitals on low-bandwidth networks.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mt-6">4. Children’s Online Privacy Protection (COPPA & GDPR-K)</h2>
      <p>
        Biggan.me does not knowingly collect or solicit personally identifiable information from children under the age of 13. If you believe any minor’s data has been provided inadvertently, please contact our administrative desk for immediate removal.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
